-868C-7DAFCE0146FB","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は暗闇から鋭い攻撃を受ける。\nそして、ぐちゃりと何か飛び散る。","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceDuration":7.210430839002267,"slideTitle":"第6スライド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第29話\/やられ怒り.png","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"title":"シーン 6","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第29話_ada4ea99a0\/元女子校の日常　第29話_ada4ea99a0.006.jpeg","id":"058035DB-A6A0-42C7-928C-B287EEA3F744","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それが血だとわかると、彼女から離れようとする。","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_006_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceDuration":1.280748299319728,"slideTitle":"第7スライド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第29話\/やられ怒り.png","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"title":"シーン 7","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第29話_ada4ea99a0\/元女子校の日常　第29話_ada4ea99a0.007.jpeg","id":"F7388D2A-86A7-4F04-8928-BE8F797A7800","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「逃げるな、目の前の景色を目に焼き付けなさい…\nそうじゃないと次は、あなたの番になるわよ。」","audioTrack":"track_voice_sub","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_パチュリー・ノーレッジ